OL,3,AKing makes clear Harry and Meghan
OL,4,Aremain non-working royals
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been sent to Prince Harry's
OL,7,Fteam, government departments, military
OL,8,Fofficials and Lord Lieutenants,
OL,9,Faccording to Palace sources.
